   "title": "21.1 Module 21 Introduction: Japan, America, and the Pacific",
   "description": "<div id=\"sparkled-assessment\"><div style=\"background:#1C1F4A; border-bottom:4px solid #F2A08A; border-radius:10px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#F2A08A; margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>MODULE INTRODUCTION</strong></div><div style=\"font-family:'Old Standard TT',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-size:26px; color:#FFFDF8; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:6px;\">Module Introduction: Japan, America, and the Pacific</div><div style=\"font-size:15px; color:#F2A08A;\">Survey · 2 questions · not graded</div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center; color:#F2A08A; font-size:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\">☼ ─ ☼ ─ ☼</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:2px solid #B73F33; margin:0 0 16px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #D5D8EC; border-top:4px solid #1C1F4A; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#1C1F4A; color:#FFFDF8; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Before you start</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#17183A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 0;\">Welcome to Japan, America, and the Pacific. Answer the questions below before you open the first lesson. Your answers help your teacher see where the class is starting. This survey is not graded.</p></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #D5D8EC; border-left:5px solid #B73F33; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 18px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#B73F33; margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>This module's goals:</strong></div><ul style=\"font-size:17px; color:#17183A; line-height:1.6; margin:0; padding-left:26px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Explain why Japan and the United States moved toward war in 1941 and what Pearl Harbor did and did not accomplish.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Describe Japan’s early conquests and how the Battle of Midway was won.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">Weigh what part codebreaking, skill, and chance each played at Midway.</li></ul></div>\n</div>",
